WEBVTT

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:15.890
On that cold night, I came to realize

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.870
that there's a place deeper down
that hurts even more than injuries

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:26.100
In this world painted with lies

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.710
where it's not clear what's true anymore

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:33.610
I wanted to keep you safe

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:40.750
The moment that
distortion and love overlapped,

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:48.830
the wind embraced the
sadness that had closed in

00:00:48.830 --> 00:01:00.140
I'll never forget your sole voice
that continues to echo through the sky

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:08.980
The prayer is going to melt
away and disappear, just like snow

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:13.620
Today, I'll increase my speed again

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.720
as I search for the reason for living

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:29.120
even if I can't be a hero just yet

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:39.770
Stop!

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.590
The experimental city of
Bethlehem has been liberated

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:50.920
and made a place where
brethren from around the world

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:54.590
who share our faith can
gather and refine learning.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:56.250
Okay!

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:01.530
Already, it boasts a track
record of over half a century

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:05.370
of self-sufficiency and complete autonomy,

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:09.210
and is an ideal location
for spiritual contemplation

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:12.640
for all peoples who hold love for God.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:19.990
This is terrible...

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:24.420
But I have no right to look away.

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:28.090
I'm the one who's driven
Joseph this far, after all.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:32.660
Why did it come to this?

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:36.670
It's all the fault of my research.

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:39.840
I wanted to explore new human potential.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:43.840
I felt the world might finally be saved

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:50.210
if I could create someone that
could put us on the right path again.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:55.190
When I look back now,
I realize it was nothing but arrogance.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.920
Until I learned the truth behind it,

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:01.060
I thought Zwolf was just
an ordinary financial backer.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:04.560
By the time I realized it, it was too late.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:09.970
They started using my research
at a level beyond my reach.

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:12.640
What they needed was a pilot enhancement plan

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:15.210
that could be used instead of cyborg operations

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.610
for the purpose of operating
their mobile weapons.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:24.950
By fusing pilot and machine,
they completed the perfect weapon.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:30.690
Without knowing this, my lover
volunteered to be a test subject,

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:35.930
after which he became a savior
convinced he can set the world right.

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:38.950
And that's Magwald Xargin...

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.930
I take it Joseph told you.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:46.870
That's right. I changed him into a monster.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:50.080
And now I'm doing the same with my own brother.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.140
Why are you...

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:56.650
Why are you still helping Zwolf?

00:03:56.650 --> 00:04:00.390
To end their suffering.

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:03.820
To atone for everything I've done.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:10.660
That's not what he, what Joseph, wants!

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:15.200
Maybe not. Joseph has
always been too nice of a person.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:19.400
But the sins I bear are
too heavy to be forgiven.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:22.030
Your own brother is the same way.

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:29.480
Malek-kun's symptoms appear to
be a classic case of locked-in syndrome,

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:34.620
but I can't find any organic damage
to his brain or his nervous system.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:38.490
It's possible that deep emotional scars

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:41.660
are preventing his deep psyche from awakening.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:44.130
Then Malek is?

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:49.330
We need to let him know that he
can come back to us without worry.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:52.440
We need to end the
nightmare he's caught up in.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:55.570
That's the first and most important thing now.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:22.900
How did I?

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:25.800
Excuse me. Are you not feeling well?

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.440
Damn it...

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:48.220
How the hell did I?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.170
That's right...

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:58.470
Amanda's in there...

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:01.530
I have to hurry... and save her...

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:09.800
I'm delighted to have you back!

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:15.590
I'm very glad.

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:21.030
Preparations are looking good here.
Begin the operation as planned.

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:23.060
Yeah, understood.

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:25.890
I have high hopes for you, Wolf.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:34.010
Our big break has finally arrived!

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:37.200
Let's show 'em what XAT is made of!

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:47.450
- I'll send you that data later.
- Great, thanks.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:05.140
This area is for authorized personnel only.

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:06.600
I'm...

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:09.010
ID confirmation requested.

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:11.170
Please place your fingers on the plate.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.150
Father Marcus Lebowski, confirmed.

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:37.300
Welcome! To where are you headed?

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:39.740
Where is Amanda Werner located?

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:42.070
Searching data.

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:45.800
One search result. Displaying on navigator.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:49.470
Amanda...

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.580
Malek...

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:06.000
It's possible that deep emotional scars

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.300
are preventing his deep psyche from awakening.

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:13.760
Damn...

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:26.440
Amanda.

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:34.760
Amanda... You're all right!

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.250
That voice...

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:38.930
Hermann!

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:40.630
Is it really you?!

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:45.640
Thank goodness! I didn't know you were alive!

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:48.700
Amanda. You need to get out of here right now.

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:56.680
You're badly hurt...

00:08:56.680 --> 00:09:00.390
Are you okay? You look pale, too.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:04.790
Oh, I'm fine. Not back in top form yet, but...

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:12.660
But why are you here? Did Victor scout you, too?

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.800
What about the chief now?

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:18.460
Hermann?

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:25.110
Tell me, Hermann. Why are you here?

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:28.180
Isn't it obvious?! I'm here to rescue you!

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:31.320
I heard you were being held in this castle!

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.980
Hermann.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.080
Okay! Let's go!

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.390
Okay. Come in.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.960
Come on, Amanda!

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:46.130
Let's get out of here! This place is dangerous!

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:50.200
Hold on, Hermann. You
seem to have the wrong idea.

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:53.600
I'm here of my own free will.

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:59.040
Don't be stupid! These are
the guys who created Blue!

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:01.610
Malek is here.

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:05.980
I think the only way to
save him will be found here.

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:07.640
What?

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:14.890
No, I don't agree with what
the Zwolf organization has done.

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:19.450
But it's also true that they're risking
their lives to defeat Amalgams now.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:24.500
Some of them I even feel I can trust.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:29.310
That's crazy, helping these guys!

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:32.880
That means you're on Blue's side then!

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:37.370
Joseph Jobson. That's his name.

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:42.020
Hermann. You have it all wrong.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:46.520
Joseph was never once our enemy.

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:47.990
That's a lie...

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:52.200
Amanda... You're being tricked!

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:58.240
Tell me, Hermann. How
did you find out about Zwolf?

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:00.700
How did you know where I was?

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:04.640
Hermann!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.770
What's wrong?! Hermann!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.050
That woman...

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:15.050
What is this?! Every time I try
to remember something, my head...

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:18.090
Hermann! You've lost your memory?

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:19.750
Beatrice...

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:24.330
I'm sure that's what she called herself...

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:27.800
She said Zwolf was our common enemy...

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:32.500
Zwolf's... enemy?

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:39.610
The guys in this castle used
Blue to control the Amalgams, right?

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:43.480
They're the ones who tricked Wolf, too...

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:48.110
Hermann, you...

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:53.220
- They've found me out?!
- No. This is!

00:11:56.760 --> 00:12:00.130
Zeppelin Air Base is under
attack by a squad of Amalgams!

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:02.770
The Defense Agency requests Zwolf intervention!

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:07.000
Request received. Apocalypse
Knights, prepare for launch!

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:10.880
Roger! Apocalypse Knights, prepare for launch!

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:14.910
So the military has lost
its ability to rely on pride.

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:17.380
Excellent, excellent.

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:32.730
Scale-rider, ready for launch!

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.030
Sword-rider, setup complete!

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.060
Bow-rider, all green!

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:45.880
Apocalypse Knights... launch!

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:51.980
What the?! What's going on?!

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:53.220
Hermann!

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:55.250
How did you make it this far?

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:58.090
They ran fingerprint and retinal checks, right?

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:02.080
Yeah. But I somehow managed to fool them.

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:04.700
That's strange.

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:09.130
You can fake an ID card, but
you can't possibly fake biometrics.

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:11.600
Did you undergo cosmetic surgery or something?

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.300
No...

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:23.250
What is it, Hermann?

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:26.250
Was something done to your body?

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:30.450
Try to remember! Any ideas at all, Hermann?!

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:34.880
I... My body...

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.230
Back then, I!

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:43.500
What's wrong, Hermann?!

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:47.670
Back then, I...

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:52.100
...died?!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.310
If so...

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:58.820
...then who...
- Pull yourself together, Hermann!

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:02.910
...is this person who's alive now?!

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:09.930
Hermann, you're...

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.160
Hermann!

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.750
Hermann!

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.050
Don't look!

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:37.520
Don't look at me!

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:39.180
Hermann?!

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:44.980
I'm... an Amalgam!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.770
Wait! Hermann!

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:54.170
Intruder inside the base!
Amalgam detected in Area D4!

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:57.700
What?! How in the world did it get inside?!

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:03.240
Damn it! I'm... I'm!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:28.040
Hermann...

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:31.410
Don't tell me he got to me, too!

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:40.840
Damn you, Wolf! You bastard!

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:49.920
Seal off all further areas!
We're going to corner it!

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:59.340
Bastard...

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:01.210
So you are here...

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:07.440
This is all your fault!
It's all because of you!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:12.140
I'll make you pay for this! You're dead!

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.420
I'm going to kill you!

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:22.560
Damn you... Damn you!

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.910
The intruder has stolen the Triple-Six!

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:43.710
That can't be!

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:45.380
The Triple-Six...

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:53.260
This can't be happening!
What about self-destruct codes?!

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:58.700
None are installed because
it hasn't been test-driven yet!

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:02.070
Dispatch the Paladin squad!
Damage to the facility is allowed!

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:04.300
Stop it at all costs!

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:14.340
Hermann! Don't be hasty!

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:30.290
Stay out of my way!

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:07.800
Stop!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.700
Stop, Hermann!

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.570
Hermann!

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:43.560
Damn!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:02.190
Looks like he's disappointed us.

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:05.290
Well, so much for the feint operation.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:09.860
What do we do? The plan required
throwing the rest into confusion.

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:13.600
- Ls the plan off?
- No. It will continue.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:15.930
Don't worry about what doesn't concern you.

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:22.070
I have no choice. It looks like I'm
the only one who can make up for him.

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:25.840
Two Paladins heavily damaged!
Triple-Six continues to flee!

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:28.450
Headquarters seems to be in a real mess.

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:30.910
What do we do? Forget these guys?

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:34.850
We haven't been ordered back
to base. The mission takes priority.

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:38.260
We need to bring Zeppelin
Air Base under control first.

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:39.960
As quickly as we can.

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:44.290
Six Amalgams detected dead-ahead!
Approaching at subsonic speed!

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:51.670
They're Typhoons that were deployed at the base.

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:54.570
The base must've fallen right into their hands.

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:59.110
Looks like they're kindly saving
us the trouble of going to them.

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:04.450
Wait! Another one is approaching
from 6 o'clock at tremendous speed!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:14.460
A pincer attack, huh? Looks like
these ones'll put up a good fight.

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:16.990
We have no choice. We'll have to take them on.

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:19.330
All units, prepare for aerial combat!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:20.990
Roger!

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:48.830
Please, Hermann!

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:52.320
I don't want to lose anyone else!

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.570
Damn!

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:19.610
Hermann. Even as an
Amalgam, you're still Hermann!

00:21:54.120 --> 00:22:05.240
I dreamed of that day we chased shooting stars

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:15.650
What we had kept safe disappeared like sand

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:19.720
Just another illusion

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:28.820
Asleep, inside memories

00:22:30.060 --> 00:22:32.360
Wish for the stars

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:40.900
Holding countless wishes with both hands

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:43.470
A wish for the stars

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:51.420
Quietly by your side, as you sleep

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:57.050
Yes, right next to you

00:22:57.050 --> 00:23:03.030
Holding countless wishes

00:23:03.030 --> 00:23:08.790
Yes, right beside you

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:15.670
The steel armies clash.

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:21.010
Those who've surpassed humanity
now struggle for world supremacy.

00:23:21.010 --> 00:23:24.980
Episode 17: "Bellow of the Beast."

00:23:24.980 --> 00:23:28.680
Who will survive in the
wastelands of Armageddon?
